<title>NETHERLANDS: Shares in Norit leap on strong results.</title>
<headline>Shares in Norit leap on strong results.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in carbon maker Norit jumped almost 13 percent, or 3.50 guilders, to 30.70 on Monday.</p>
<p>The company reported a profit rise to 18.5 million guilders in 1996 from 11.0 million guilders in 1995 on Friday after the bourse closed.</p>
<p>&quot;The company showed strong figures on Friday and it is no longer a sleepy stock,&quot; said one dealer.</p>
<p>Norit said on Friday it expected a continuing increase in turnover and profit.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
